| tips = *Ravenous snapshots ability stat bonuses (e.g. {{M|Energy Conversion}}, {{M|Growing Power}}) and will keep the same stats if recast before expiring.

*Ravenous is a formidable tool to protect objectives and control the map due to the Maggots forcing enemies to attack them instead of players or objectives . 

*The passive heal and status clear make it valuable when fighting {{Faction|Techrot|icon=only}} [[Technocyte Coda]] in their arena .

**Placing {{A|Ravenous}} on the edge of the arena will allow the {{E|Maggot| Maggots}} to spawn outside of arena's bounds and reach enemies that are not yet in .

**Using {{A|Virulence}} while touching the arena's edge will allow you to detonate them .

*Constantly detonating {{E|Maggot| Maggots}} using {{A|Virulence}} helps maximize damage output and Mutation gained as Maggots will continuously respawn throughout the duration of Ravenous.
*{{E|Maggot|Maggots}} can pick up motes from {{WF|Wisp}}'s {{A|Reservoirs}} ability. They are also affected by {{A|Mesmer Skin}}.
